<title>USA: CalEnergy drops bid for NYSEG.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy drops bid for NYSEG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent power producer CalEnergy Co. Inc. said on Friday it was dropping its attempt to acquire New York State Electric &amp; Gas Corp. due to a lack of support from target company shareholders.</p>
<p>CalEnergy said a $159 million tender offer launched to acquire 9.9 percent of NYSEG shares was undersubscribed. The tender was the first step in its effort to acquire the whole company in a transaction valued at $1.9 billion.</p>
</text>
